# CVE-2026-91403: OpenJDK <= 21.0.13 eMudhra intermediate CA compromise (JSSE / javax.net.ssl).
# Mitigated in-image across builder (bellsoft/liberica-openjdk-alpine:21) and runtime (gcr.io/distroless/java21-debian13:nonroot)
# via devsecops/compliance/java-security/blocked.certs (54 SHA-256 fingerprints including all 16 compromised eMudhra/Sectigo CAs)
# plus strict TLS revocation checking (-Dcom.sun.net.ssl.checkRevocation=true -Dcom.sun.security.enableCRLDP=true).
CVE-2026-91403
